WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.075
Let’s walk through Record an explicit outcome.

00:00:03.075 --> 00:00:05.975
On this slide, use Copy, then Mark done

00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:08.975
, and leave pending work visible until the external handoff

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.188
is complete.

00:00:10.188 --> 00:00:14.250
In practice, a completed acknowledgement proves the transfer step

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:14.350
;

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.350
it does not change White Cell adjudication.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.925
Use the highlighted Workflow controls area as your visual reference

00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:22.575
while you complete this check.
